{"version":1,"key":"card:588","content":{"id":588,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"39655cbe-ba80-467f-8c9e-5608ec4b56c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么要记笔记？有人说经常用的不用记，不常用的记着没用，所以根本没有记笔记的必要。我认为大错特错："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a87cb5bc-1ba5-447c-a030-9cd3814ef356","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ba1a02a4-c039-4a02-b585-12d4e01208be","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8b85aa03-25ac-4395-bfab-b8546836ee99","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经常用的不用记：人总是会高估了自己的记忆力，著名的遗忘曲线告诉我们，人类遗忘的速度是如此之快，而记录是对抗遗忘最好的手段"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a5cf69af-0c1f-4842-85c8-0a0f14ab27d3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"97c24807-96d4-4929-9e8b-f81a0254e012","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不常用的记着没用：不常用不等于未来不用，你不能等到需要用的时候从头再学，另外知识之间是相互关联的，看似无用的知识可能是你深入理解其他知识的关键"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8fd1c825-18bc-4f17-aa5f-c17ea98bfb14","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之所以产生上述的想法明显对记笔记这件事情有很大的误解："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e433a47e-5ef1-43d0-9ca9-0f7be4a12316","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"09a2e9de-c611-4980-87bf-803f484e3a83","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"89e18f62-ce61-4566-8d21-30c742ef4645","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"忽略了记笔记的过程"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7d1b6fd3-11be-44a8-b658-0894573e6058","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认为记笔记只是把知识点摘抄下来，这也是很多人的做法，比如："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"eda5b341-ee87-4984-a016-0be2fc647c90","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"77d035da-9a34-4ae9-948f-e7db7587b7e8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"853f58e1-9006-4ab7-9d8e-1484885aa145","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上课抄板书"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7267a15d-4a9c-417e-a3d5-2c4223db1fb4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"94778315-7837-48fa-8c7e-2a981535abf6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"读书划线，摘抄句子"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3aaf9e5a-e2cb-407d-a707-9fd6cc1cfcb3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"仅仅"},{"type":"formatted","text":"是这样，的确没有记的必要，因为不论是通过搜索引擎还是 AI 都可以获得到这些内容，何必浪费时间。"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"但这是不对的做法"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，根据"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":27,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":30,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"e20702bd-030d-4de7-91be-1ab36a8ed1a3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"必要难度理论"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，存储越容易，提取就越困难，这种未经思考的摘录，过了一段时间就记不起来了，就仿佛没学过一样。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"f539111f-bc79-45c6-92d1-aa17b52d0d03","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"912b232c-100a-4779-a801-87e7a4397798","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我这里说的不对不是上课记笔记、读书摘抄不对，而是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"仅仅这样做是不对的"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a8c22af-157e-4951-964c-4ce25b539e54","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更重要的是要对学习的内容产生思考，网上流传的学习效率金字塔"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4cf692ce-48d5-41d5-9de5-40ef99a4d8fa.png","uuid":"e06ac9e2-17d7-4f43-9bf3-6bea04534e11","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4cf692ce-48d5-41d5-9de5-40ef99a4d8fa.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3e9b8fc2-67d4-4952-b3cd-5c3aa8346286","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a029e144-21e0-4b9a-af50-abfefa327e96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么是这样，关键点就是不同的学习方式大脑参与思考的程度不同，从上到下思考越来越深，而思考的过程就是大脑在建立神经元联系的过程，思考的越深入，建立的联系更牢固，自然留存率就高。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ffbf1e1a-391f-4d8a-b0cb-6d46003b5e3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以正确的记笔记方法是在记笔记时让大脑参与思考，具体方法就是用自己的话去写，因为在用自己的语言组织笔记内容时，会强迫我们去进行思考，所以与其说是记笔记，不如说是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"写笔记"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b2dbf501-1432-44fb-b26f-c5acd83fc202","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果把这种记笔记的方法放到上面的金字塔中，我认为和教授给他人是同一层级的，因为我们写的笔记是为了给未来的自己看的，这就是等效于"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","bold":true,"text":"教授给未来的自己"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此判断是否记了一篇合格笔记的标准就是未来的自己在看到这篇笔记时能轻易的看懂并应用。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"de042de9-0c99-48ee-a02c-439b6e593e0a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bc81c809-af4a-4218-9944-505a22255587","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"忽略了笔记间的联系"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a3fa681b-c11f-4c5c-bef2-76dae3623484","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记笔记另一个重要目的是帮助我们构建自己的知识体系。为什么构建知识体系这件事情这么重要，我们可以反向思考，如果没有形成知识体系会怎么样："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"dcbff096-5c06-4129-b6e6-c962259fe66d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"93b5420d-2a61-4c30-a251-be5214d3c259","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"066261af-6bd9-4c0c-8162-6338d262447a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认知效率低下，面对新信息无法纳入已有认知框架，需要耗费大量精力才能理解"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"28b190b1-5c3e-4aae-b177-c45deaf4fcf1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f0390f27-9179-4f53-a835-bbf75f4edc36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题解决能力受限，解决问题思路狭窄，面对复杂问题只能根据经验或模仿，无创新能力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"31dc4fb0-ab84-46bb-8ddd-e6248d87139e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15fb25c0-8185-4dc4-80ad-437e86e76401","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"难以深入学习，学习如同盲人摸象，不知道什么是重点，抓不住核心概念"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1ad51717-3933-4171-9839-0916e0897148","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那如何在记笔记时构建知识体系呢，这就要求在记笔记时要时刻思考笔记与笔记之间的联系，现在很多笔记笔记都提供了在笔记之间建立联系的能力，常见的手段有文件夹、标签、索引笔记、双链，最好可以通过一些可视化的手段去直观的看到已有的知识体系，从而查漏补缺，完善知识体系。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6ffd00df-57e5-4787-801b-13b30568cd5f.png","uuid":"c88c64f1-98f6-49b2-8818-00af03e8ae17","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6ffd00df-57e5-4787-801b-13b30568cd5f.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"88e5f32f-1a95-466c-ac52-bc97378ac4b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}],"tags":["思考","学习方法"],"createTime":1747556107871,"updateTime":1752401539347,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752401539347},"links":{"card:30":{"key":"card:30","type":"card","id":30}}}